<view class="page {{senior?'senior':''}} {{reducedMotion?'reduced-motion':''}}"><view class="page-title">按你习惯的方式</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{storageError}}">{{storageError}}</view><view class="panel"><view class="switch-row"><view><view class="field-label">大字模式</view><view class="field-help">放大正文和操作按钮</view></view><switch checked="{{senior}}" data-field="senior" bindchange="change" color="#185b50" aria-label="大字模式" /></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="switch-row"><view><view class="field-label">减少动效</view><view class="field-help">保留文字与倒计时，减少画面移动</view></view><switch checked="{{reducedMotion}}" data-field="reducedMotion" bindchange="change" color="#185b50" aria-label="减少动效" /></view></view>
  <view class="section-title">数据留在这部手机</view><view class="panel"><view>不需要注册账号。</view><view class="bullet">评估、训练记录与报告副本只在本机保存。</view><view class="bullet">没有云开发、健康数据上传、自动备份或跨手机同步。</view><view class="bullet">更换手机、删除小程序或清理微信存储后，资料可能丢失。</view><view class="field-help">当前有 {{counts.daily}} 条每日评估、{{counts.sessions}} 条训练记录。</view><button class="link-button" bindtap="reports">管理本机报告文件</button></view>
  <button class="link-button" bindtap="togglePrivacy">{{privacyOpen?'收起':'查看'}}数据使用说明</button><view class="panel" wx:if="{{privacyOpen}}"><view class="bullet">不读取微信头像、昵称、手机号、通讯录或定位。</view><view class="bullet">只有你主动选择报告时，才读取选中的文件并复制到本机。选取功能可能需要微信隐私授权。</view><view class="bullet">在线音乐只有点击播放才联网；复制教学来源链接不会附带健康记录。外部平台自身的数据规则由其另行说明。</view><view class="bullet">微信负责代码分发、平台基础服务与存储管理。这里承诺的是本应用不主动上传健康数据，不能代替微信平台本身的隐私说明。</view><view class="bullet">手机本机存储并不等于独立加密保险箱。请保护好手机解锁与微信访问权限。</view></view>
  <view class="panel-quiet"><view class="field-help">清除后无法从服务器恢复，因为本应用不保留云端副本。</view><button class="btn-danger" bindtap="clear" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" hover-class="press-lift">清除本机资料</button></view><view class="field-help">壶兰呼吸 · 小程序 1.0.0</view>
</view>
